    "pol.s8.r1.duration": "Session",
    "pol.s8.r2.purpose": "Measuring conversions and remarketing on Facebook/Instagram",
    "pol.s8.r2.duration": "90 days / 24 months",
    "pol.s8.r3.type": "Preference cookies",
    "pol.s8.r3.purpose": "Remembering your choices (e.g. closed popup)",
    "pol.s8.r3.duration": "Session",
    "pol.s8.p2": "You can control or disable cookies in your browser settings. Note that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of the website. To opt out of Meta cookies, visit the <a href='https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policies/cookies/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Facebook cookies policy</a>.",
    "pol.s9.num": "Section 9",
    "pol.s9.title": "Children and minors",
    "pol.s9.p1": "Nova Music Academy offers lessons for children aged 4 and above. Personal data of minors under 16 is collected and processed <strong>exclusively with the explicit consent of the parent or legal representative</strong>, given at the time of enrolment.",
    "pol.s9.p2": "The parent or legal guardian has the right to access, rectify or request the deletion of the child's data by contacting us at the email address indicated in the contact section.",
    "pol.s9.p3": "We do not intentionally collect data from minors through the online forms on the website without the involvement of an adult.",
    "pol.s10.num": "Section 10",
    "pol.s10.title": "Data security",
    "pol.s10.p1": "We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data against unauthorised access, loss, destruction or disclosure:",
    "pol.s10.li1": "Secure HTTPS connection across the entire website",
    "pol.s10.li2": "Access to data limited to staff who need it to provide the services",
    "pol.s10.li3": "Data processing partners (e.g. Web3Forms, DigitalOcean) with verified security standards",
    "pol.s10.li4": "Regular data backups",
    "pol.s10.p2": "In the event of a security incident affecting your rights and freedoms, we will notify you in accordance with the obligations set out in the GDPR (Art. 33–34).",
    "pol.s11.num": "Section 11",
    "pol.s11.title": "Changes to this policy",
    "pol.s11.p1": "We reserve the right to update this policy periodically to reflect changes in our data processing practices or legislative amendments. The date of the last update is displayed in the header of this document.",
    "pol.s11.p2": "In the event of significant changes, we will notify you by email (if you have provided your address) or through a visible notice on the website before the changes take effect.",
    "pol.s12.num": "Section 12",
    "pol.s12.title": "Contact and complaints",
    "pol.s12.p1": "For any question, request to exercise your rights or complaint regarding the processing of your personal data, you can contact us:",
